 72364                           ;	FCMENP = ON, FSCM timer will set FSCMP bit and OSFIF interrupt on Primary XTAL failure
 72365                           ;	Fail-Safe Clock Monitor -Secondary XTAL Enable bit
 72366                           ;	FCMENS = ON, FSCM timer will set FSCMS bit and OSFIF interrupt on Secondary XTAL failu
      +                          re
