 72373                           ;	Power-up timer selection bits
 72374                           ;	PWRTS = PWRT_OFF, PWRT is disabled
 72375                           ;	Multi-vector enable bit
 72376                           ;	MVECEN = ON, Multi-vector enabled, Vector table used for interrupts
 72377                           ;	IVTLOCK bit One-way set enable bit
 72378                           ;	IVT1WAY = ON, IVTLOCKED bit can be cleared and set only once
 72379                           ;	Low Power BOR Enable bit
